      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAG Workflow Overview\n\nThis workflow demonstrates **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** - a technique that enhances AI responses with external knowledge.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Documents are split into chunks\n2. Chunks are converted to embeddings (vectors)\n3. Embeddings are stored in a vector database\n4. User queries retrieve relevant chunks\n5. AI generates answers using retrieved context",
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "592b62dd-f7d9-4ab2-9d1d-3caf8deb5a82",
      "name": "Sticky Note d130cc9c",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## INDEXING PHASE\n\n**Purpose:** Load documents into the vector store\n\n**Steps:**\n- Provide your document text\n- Text is split into 1000-char chunks (200 overlap)\n- Each chunk becomes a vector embedding\n- Stored in memory with key \"rag_demo\"\n\n**Run this branch first to populate the knowledge base**",
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8e4d09f-1439-4be5-a5b6-50e560cc981a",
      "name": "Sticky Note 9b3498e6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        1104
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## QUERY PHASE\n\n**Purpose:** Ask questions about your documents\n\n**Steps:**\n- User asks a question\n- Question is converted to embedding\n- Top 4 most similar chunks are retrieved\n- AI Agent uses chunks as context\n- Generates accurate, grounded answer\n\n**Run this after indexing to query your knowledge**",
        "color": 3
      }
    }
  ],
